  "body": "**Blocked by:** #26, #99\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue establishes the first implementation slice of the `mail-live-sync` batch; #196 builds on it.\n\n## Task\n\nBuild mailsync composition root: discover active accounts; exactly one provider lifecycle each; stop on deactivation; restore cursors/expiry on restart; isolate failures. Signals enter existing idempotent reconcile, never parallel ingestion. Maintain next_expected_activity_at and periodic safety-net reconcile.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Provider transports/writeback follow.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Activation/deactivation starts/stops one lifecycle.\n- Restart avoids duplicate watchers.\n- Signals converge through reconcile.\n- One account failure does not stop others.\n",
